"armor-mods\t种群削弱\t深岩墓室":"<p>未携带<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>道具时：<br> 对<span class=\"bar-red\">红血</span>与<span class=\"bar-orange\">橙血</span><span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>的武器伤害提高：<br> 5% ｜ 10% ｜ 15% ｜ 20% ｜ 25%。</p>",
