"elements/stasis\t破碎俯冲\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">按［空中移动］俯冲：</span><br>最多造成 50 伤害，并<span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span> 8.5 米半径内被<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>与<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影水晶</span>。<br>对被<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>伤害提高到 180；<span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span>一名被<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>额外造成 250 <span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span>伤害，显示为黄色数字。<br><span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span><span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影水晶</span>或被<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>提供满层<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰霜护甲</span>。</p><p>俯冲期间提供 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% <span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span><span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span>伤害抗性与坠落伤害免疫。<br><span class=\"note\">每次激活之间有 4 秒冷却。</span></p>",
"elements/stasis\t破碎俯冲\t星相":"<p class=\"v\">碎片槽</p><p><span class=\"cond\">滞空按［空中移动］发动俯冲：</span><br>造成最高 50 伤害，并<span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span> 8.5 米内被<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>与<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影水晶</span>。<br>对被<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>基础伤害提升至 180 点；<span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span>一名被<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>额外造成 250 点<span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span>伤害（显示为黄色暴击数字）。<br><span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span><span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影水晶</span>或被<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>时，直接补满<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰霜护甲</span>层数。</p><p>俯冲期间提供 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% <span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span><span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span>伤害抗性并免疫坠落伤害。</p><p><span class=\"note\">每次生效之间具 4 秒冷却。</span></p>",
"elements/stasis\t碎裂\t效果":"<p><span class=\"cond\">被<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>可通过伤害或特定<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>星相触发<span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span>：</span><br>对 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>最高造成 361 <span class=\"pvp\">[</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span><span class=\"pvp\">]</span> 伤害。</p><p><span class=\"enemy\">势不可挡勇士</span>承受<span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span>伤害时进入<span class=\"enemy\">眩晕</span>。</p>",
"elements/stasis\t碎裂手雷\t手雷技能":"<p class=\"v\">基础冷却 105 秒回复倍率 0.?×</p><p><span class=\"note\">中型弹道 ｜ 粘附</span></p><p>附着于<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>表面：直击立即施加<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span> <span class=\"pvp\">[</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span><span class=\"pvp\"> 层</span><span class=\"deb-stasis\">减速</span><span class=\"pvp\">]</span>。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">延迟 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 秒后引爆：</span><br>在 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米内造成最高 <span class=\"unsure\">325?</span> <span class=\"pvp\">[</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span><span class=\"pvp\">]</span> 伤害，并呈 Y 形释放 3 组共 9 枚追踪<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>弹片。<br>每枚弹片造成 216 <span class=\"pvp\">[</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span><span class=\"pvp\">]</span> 伤害，可弹跳 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 次。<br>附着于已被<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>的目标时立即引爆，爆炸伤害提高 100%。</p>",
