"elements/stasis\t钻石长矛\t星相":"<p class=\"v\">碎片槽</p><p><span class=\"cond\">达成 1 <span class=\"pvp\">[3]</span> 次<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>武器击杀、1 次<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>技能击杀或 1 次<span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span>击杀时：</span><br>生成一柄<span class=\"el-stasis\">钻石长矛</span>（生成后具 7 <span class=\"pvp\">[17]</span> 秒内置冷却）。<br>长矛在地面上停留 25 秒，3 米内可拾取，拾取后最长持有 10 秒。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">［开火］投掷长矛：</span><br>造成 136 <span class=\"pvp\">[45]</span> 伤害并<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>撞击点 5 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>；直击可直接<span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span><span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影水晶</span>。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">［近战］地面重砸：</span><br>造成最高 180 <span class=\"pvp\">[90]</span> 伤害并<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span> 8 <span class=\"pvp\">[</span><span class=\"unsure\">6.75?</span><span class=\"pvp\">]</span> 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>，同时为<span class=\"enemy\">自己</span>与 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">盟友</span>赋予 <span class=\"stack\">2 层</span><span class=\"el-stasis\">冰霜护甲</span>。</p><p><span class=\"el-stasis\">钻石长矛</span>命中<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影水晶</span>时立即引发<span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span>；其伤害计为基础<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>技能伤害（既非手雷亦非近战）。</p>",
"elements/stasis\t锁链的低语\t异域词条":"<p class=\"v\">+10 职业</p><p><span class=\"el-stasis\">冰霜护甲</span>激活期间的击杀推进计数，满 100% 生成一枚小型<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影碎片</span>。<br><span class=\"bar-red\">红血</span> 34% ｜ <span class=\"bar-orange\">橙血</span> 67% ｜ <span class=\"bar-yellow\">初级首领</span>及以上 100% ｜ <span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span> <span class=\"unsure\">?</span>%。</p>",
"elements/stasis\t锁链的低语\t碎片":"<p class=\"v\">碎片消耗 1职业 +10</p><p><span class=\"cond\"><span class=\"el-stasis\">冰霜护甲</span>激活期间击杀推进进度，达到 100% 生成一枚小型<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影碎片</span>：</span><br><span class=\"bar-red\">红血</span> 34% ｜ <span class=\"bar-orange\">橙血</span> 67% ｜ <span class=\"bar-yellow\">初级首领</span>及以上 100% ｜ <span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span> <span class=\"unsure\">?</span>%。</p>",
"elements/stasis\t韵律之吟\t异域词条":"<p class=\"v\">—</p><p>强化<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰霜护甲</span>：上限提高到 7 层（伤害抗性 50% [<span class=\"pvp\">PvP：</span><span class=\"unsure\">16%?</span>]），每层持续时间变为 6 秒。</p>",
"elements/stasis\t韵律之吟\t碎片":"<p class=\"v\">碎片消耗 1</p><p>强化<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰霜护甲</span>：叠加叠加上限提升至 7 层（伤害抗性最高 50% <span class=\"pvp\">[</span><span class=\"unsure\">16%?</span><span class=\"pvp\">]</span>），每层持续时间延长至 6 秒。</p>",
"elements/stasis\t风暴怒吼\t异域词条":"<p>额外提供一次<span class=\"pickup\">近战技能充能</span>。<br>对被<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>的非<span class=\"bar-yellow\">首领</span><span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>造成 1.5 倍伤害（若尼芙神<span class=\"exotic\">燃烧之拳</span>激活则不适用）。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">滑铲时按［近战技能］：</span><br>打出上勾拳，造成 146 [<span class=\"pvp\">PvP：</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span>] 近战伤害，<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span> <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span><span class=\"pvp\">[PvP 改为 ? 层减速，持续 ? 秒]</span> <span class=\"unsure\">（层数与时长待测）</span>，并在使用者前方呈 V 形生成 2 块小型、4 块中型与 2 块大型<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影水晶</span>。<br>上勾拳伤害随近战属性与近战伤害<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>缩放。<br><span class=\"note\">开火状态下无法在滑铲期间使用。</span></p><p>这些水晶造成 158 [<span class=\"pvp\">PvP：</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span>] 充能<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>近战伤害，8 米内衰减至 45%；伤害计为充能<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>近战伤害，正常随近战伤害<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>缩放，但不随 100 以上的近战属性缩放。<br><span class=\"note\">冰川震击期间的风暴怒吼另有一套缩放，详见冰川震击一条。</span></p>",
"elements/stasis\t风暴怒吼\t星相":"<p class=\"v\">碎片槽</p><p>额外提供一次<span class=\"pickup\">近战技能充能</span>。<br>对被<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>的非<span class=\"bar-yellow\">首领</span><span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>造成 1.5 倍伤害（若 Perk「<span class=\"exotic\">燃烧之拳</span>」激活则不适用）。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">滑铲时按［近战技能］：</span><br>打出上勾拳造成 146 <span class=\"pvp\">[</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span><span class=\"pvp\">]</span> 近战伤害，<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span> <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span> <span class=\"pvp\">[</span><span class=\"unsure\">? 层减速，持续 ? 秒</span><span class=\"pvp\">]</span>，并在前方呈 V 形生成 2 块小型、4 块中型与 2 块大型<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影水晶</span>。<br>上勾拳伤害随近战属性与近战伤害<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>递增。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">所生成的冰晶机制：</span><br>水晶造成 158 <span class=\"pvp\">[</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span><span class=\"pvp\">]</span> 充能<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>近战伤害（在 8 米内衰减至最低 45%）。<br>伤害计为充能<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>近战伤害，正常受近战伤害<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>递增，但不随超过 100 的近战属性递增。</p><p><span class=\"note\">开火状态下无法在滑铲期间发动。超能「冰川震击」期间的风暴怒吼增幅规则见该超能说明。</span></p>",
"elements/stasis\t饥饿之吟\t异域词条":"<p class=\"v\">-20 近战</p><p><span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影碎片</span>提供的<span class=\"pickup\">近战能量</span>提高 60%。<br><span class=\"note\">与其它来源（例如渴望回响的满溢金库 +260%）相加。</span></p>",
