"shopping-heavy\t二元轨道\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">造成对立阵营属性击杀时：</span><br>伤害提高 25%，持续 8.5 <span class=\"enh\">↑10.5</span> 秒。<br>再次以对立阵营来源击杀可刷新持续时间；后台可触发，收枪后保留。</p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">对立阵营触发对应：</span><div class=\"bul\">・光明击杀（<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>／<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>／<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span>）：赋予黑暗与动能武器（<span class=\"el-kinetic\">动能</span>／<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>／<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>）</div><div class=\"bul\">・黑暗与动能击杀（<span class=\"el-kinetic\">动能</span>／<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>／<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>）：赋予光明武器（<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>／<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>／<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span>）</div></div>",
"shopping-heavy\t交感军火库\t异域词条":"<p>被动提供 +20 填装速度。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">武器击杀后 3.6 <span class=\"enh\">↑</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 秒内完成填装时：</span><br>填满收起的所有武器。</p>",
