"shopping-heavy\t眩晕恢复\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">使<span class=\"enemy\">勇士</span>踉跄或眩晕时：</span><br>填满弹匣，回复 60 点<span class=\"health\">生命值</span>并触发<span class=\"health\">生命值</span>回复。</p>",
