"shopping-heavy\t超充弹匣\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\"><span class=\"el-arc\">增幅</span>期间：</span><br>每 1.5 秒填充 5% 弹匣。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">获得速度提升期间：</span><br>每 0.25 秒填充 5% 弹匣；通过填充最多可使弹匣容量提高 100%。</p><p>两种填充效果收枪期间同样生效。</p><p><span class=\"enh\">↑被动提供 +15 弹匣属性。</span></p>",
"shopping-heavy\t超凡时刻\t异域词条":"<div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">武器击杀时：</span><br>按武器元素阵营获得对应<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>，持续 7 秒（再次击杀刷新；收枪后保留）：<div class=\"bul\">・光明武器（<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>／<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>／<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span>）：触发「<span class=\"el-prismatic\">超凡</span>之光」，+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 稳定性、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑+20</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性</div><div class=\"bul\">・黑暗武器（<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>／<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>）：触发「<span class=\"el-prismatic\">超凡</span>之暗」，+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑+20</span> 射程、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑+20</span> 瞄准辅助</div></div><p><span class=\"cond\">处于<span class=\"el-prismatic\">超凡</span>状态期间：</span><br>同时激活两种阵营加成，直到<span class=\"el-prismatic\">超凡</span>结束。</p>",
"shopping-heavy\t超因果亲和\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">造成同阵营属性击杀时：</span><br>伤害提高 20%，持续 6 <span class=\"enh\">↑7</span> 秒。<br>继续以同阵营来源击杀可刷新持续时间；后台可触发，收枪后保留。</p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">阵营对应：</span><div class=\"bul\">・光明阵营：<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>、<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>、<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・黑暗阵营：<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>、<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span></div></div>",
"shopping-heavy\t超因果流体\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">造成伤害时：</span><br>获得「<span class=\"perk\">超因果流体</span>」，持续 3 秒（收枪后仍然生效）：<br>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性、+50 敏捷、+90 <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 充能效率。</p>",
"shopping-heavy\t超级杀戮弹匣\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">武器击杀后 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 秒内完成填装时：</span><br>伤害提高 40%，持续 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑3</span> +（2 × 击杀数）秒，上限 20 秒。<br>击杀后再次填装可延长持续时间（最多 20 秒）；击杀计数收枪后保留，填装后重置。</p>",
"shopping-heavy\t越战越勇\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">弹匣余量从 50% 降至 0% 期间：</span><br>线性提供 −12.5% 至 −25% <span class=\"enh\">↑-30%</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 精度锥形范围，以及至多 +30<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 稳定性。</p>",
"shopping-heavy\t身陷重围\t异域词条":"<p>附近有三名或更多目标时，此武器可造成更高的额外伤害。</p>",
"shopping-heavy\t转向\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">命中<span class=\"bar-red\">红血</span><span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>时：</span><br>获得 <span class=\"stack\">2 层</span>「转向」，最多叠加 <span class=\"stack\">30 层</span>；收枪后保留。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">命中<span class=\"bar-orange\">橙血</span>、<span class=\"bar-yellow\">初级首领</span>、<span class=\"bar-yellow\">首领</span>或载具时：</span><br>单次开火消耗至多 <span class=\"stack\">3 ↑2 层</span>，每层使伤害提高 33% <span class=\"enh\">↑50%</span>，消耗 <span class=\"stack\">3 ↑2 层</span>时达到最高 +100%（命中免疫目标同样消耗）。</p>",
