"shopping-heavy\t近接能量\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">处于<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span> 15 米内造成武器击杀时：</span><br>每层 +15 <span class=\"enh\">↑+18</span> 近战属性，持续 10 秒，最多叠加 <span class=\"stack\">3 层</span>（最高 +45 <span class=\"enh\">↑+54</span> 近战属性）。</p>",
"shopping-heavy\t还治彼身\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">击破<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>元素护盾，或击破开启超能的<span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span>护盾时：</span><br>获得 50 点<span class=\"pickup\">覆盖护盾</span>，持续 10 <span class=\"enh\">↑11.5</span> 秒。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">护盾机制：</span><br>该<span class=\"pickup\">覆盖护盾</span>受击不中断<span class=\"health\">生命值</span>回复；可与<span class=\"el-void\">虚空覆盖护盾</span>及职业<span class=\"pickup\">覆盖护盾</span>叠加，承伤时按先进先出结算。</p>",
