"shopping-primary\t劣迹斑斑\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">施加元素<span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>时：</span><br>获得 <span class=\"stack\">2 层</span>「<span class=\"perk\">劣迹斑斑</span>」，最多叠加 <span class=\"stack\">10 层</span>（后台可触发，收枪后保留；武器击杀消耗 1 <span class=\"pvp\">[2]</span> 层）：<br>提供 +30<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑+35</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性与 +30<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑+35</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度（刀剑获得 +20<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 充能效率）。</p>",
"shopping-primary\t动态减摆\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">扣住扳机持续开火期间：</span><br>每射击一发 +1 稳定性，精度锥角 -<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>-<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>%，精度锥增长 -10% <span class=\"enh\">↑-12.5%</span>。<br>持续开火 10 <span class=\"enh\">↑8</span> 发后达到满额加成：+10 稳定性、精度锥增长 -100%、移除全部弹丸散布。</p>",
"shopping-primary\t动态热量武器\t异域词条":"<p>高基础伤害，提升对强力战斗人员造成的伤害，高热量积累。[填装]  以释放武器热量。过热将强制持续排气。武器在射击间隙冷却得更快。</p>",
"shopping-primary\t动能震颤\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">对同一目标连续直击达标（相邻命中间隔不超过 3 秒，收枪后计数保留）：</span><br>延迟 0.25 秒后在目标脚下每秒释放 1 道冲击波（共 3 道，距上一道冲击波 2 秒内不可再次对该目标触发）：<br>每道冲击波在 6 米内造成最高 90 <span class=\"pvp\">[20]</span> 点<span class=\"el-kinetic\">动能</span>武器伤害。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">冲击波伤害加成：</span><br>伤害取决于最初触发时<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>的档位；在<span class=\"bar-yellow\">初级首领</span>或<span class=\"bar-yellow\">首领</span>身上触发时伤害提高 33.3%。<br>享受<span class=\"el-kinetic\">动能</span>武器额外伤害加成，并按<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>档位倍率折算。</p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">触发所需直击命中数：</span><div class=\"bul\">・微型冲锋枪：14 <span class=\"enh\">↑13</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・自动步枪：12 <span class=\"enh\">↑11</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・脉冲步枪：11 <span class=\"enh\">↑10</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・非点射手枪：8 <span class=\"enh\">↑7</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・180 射速手炮 ｜ 180 射速斥候步枪：6 <span class=\"enh\">↑5</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・140 射速手炮 ｜ 120／150 射速斥候步枪：5 <span class=\"enh\">↑4</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・微型导弹手枪：4 <span class=\"enh\">↑3</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・弓箭 ｜ 狙击步枪：3 <span class=\"enh\">↑2</span> 次</div></div>",
"shopping-primary\t医治\t异域词条":"<div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">触发支援型框架加速时：</span><br>为<span class=\"enemy\">自己</span>与目标<span class=\"enemy\">盟友</span>赋予支援型自动步枪同属性<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>：<div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>：获得<span class=\"el-arc\">增幅</span>，持续 5 秒</div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>：获得 <span class=\"stack\">1 层</span><span class=\"el-solar\">恢复</span>，持续 5 <span class=\"enh\">↑7.5</span> 秒</div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>：双方均获得 <span class=\"stack\">2 层</span><span class=\"el-stasis\">冰霜护甲</span>，持续 5 秒</div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>：<span class=\"enemy\">自己</span>释放 4 根解<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>线</div></div>",
