"shopping-primary\t沙场备战\t异域词条":"<p>被动提供 +20 <span class=\"enh\">↑+30</span> 弹药生成。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">蹲伏期间：</span><br>+50 <span class=\"enh\">↑+55</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度、填装时长倍率 0.8×、切枪动画时长倍率 0.8×。</p>",
