"shopping-primary\t潜匿弓箭\t异域词条":"<p>被动提供 +15 弹药生成。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">蹲伏期间：</span><br>开火不触发雷达信号，拉弓蓄满保持时间延长 25%。<br>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度、填装时长倍率 0.8×，<span class=\"enh\">↑生效期间额外 +</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span><span class=\"enh\"> 稳定性</span>。</p>",
