"shopping-primary\t精细调整\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">发热量从 0% 上升至 50% 的过程中，加成随热量平滑衰减：</span><br>0% 发热量时提供最高 +<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑22</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 射程、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性、精度锥增长 -<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>-<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>%。<br>加成自 0% 发热量时的 100% 效果平滑降至 50% 发热量时的 50% 效果。</p>",
