"shopping-primary\t结晶残花\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">武器击杀时：</span><br>获得「<span class=\"perk\">结晶残花</span>」，持续 4 秒。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">「<span class=\"perk\">结晶残花</span>」生效期间造成武器击杀时：</span><br>目标阵亡时释放 1 枚<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>追踪弹。<br>追踪弹随机飞行约 3<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米，消散时生成 1 座中型<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>大型<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影水晶</span>。</p>",
