"shopping-primary\t绝路专注\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">开火或挥刀时：</span><br>获得「<span class=\"perk\">绝路专注</span>」层数，持续 2 秒（开火或挥刀刷新持续时间；收枪移除）：<br>线性提供至多 +10 <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 射程、−7.5%<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>-<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% 精度锥尺寸、<span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% <span class=\"enh\">↑</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span>% 弹头速度与刀剑突进距离提升。</p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">各武器类型满层要求：</span><div class=\"bul\">・自动步枪 ｜ 微型冲锋枪：11 发射击</div><div class=\"bul\">・手枪：5 发射击</div><div class=\"bul\">・手炮 ｜ 斥候步枪：4 发射击</div><div class=\"bul\">・刀剑：挥刀 5 次（突进距离提升至多 100%）</div><div class=\"bul\">・榴弹发射器：射击 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 发</div></div>",
