"shopping-special\t双脚架\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">被动提供：</span><br>+1 弹匣容量、+5 备弹，开火恢复延迟 0.75×。<br>代价为伤害降低 25%，-30 <span class=\"enh\">↑-25</span> 爆炸范围，-20 <span class=\"enh\">↑-15</span> 填装速度。</p><p><span class=\"note\">狼群弹药以及 Perk「</span><span class=\"perk\">集束炸弹</span><span class=\"note\">」、Perk「</span><span class=\"perk\">幼雏</span><span class=\"note\">」等附加伤害均受该伤害惩罚削减。</span></p>",
