"shopping-special\t热力四射\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">武器击杀时：</span><br>获得 <span class=\"stack\">1 层</span>「<span class=\"perk\">热力四射</span>」，持续 5.5 <span class=\"enh\">↑6.5</span> 秒，最多叠加 <span class=\"stack\">2 层</span>；收枪后保留。</p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">各层加成：</span><div class=\"bul\">・×1：+15 稳定性、+20 后坐方向、精度锥角 -15%、精度锥增长 -15%</div><div class=\"bul\">・×2：+30 稳定性、+40 后坐方向、精度锥角 -25%、精度锥增长 -25%</div></div>",
"shopping-special\t热能雾化\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">热量从 50% 升至 100% 的过程中：</span><br>直击伤害提高 8.25% <span class=\"unsure\">[3.5?%]</span> 至约 14% <span class=\"unsure\">[?%]</span>（不提高爆炸伤害类 Perk 的伤害）。</p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">直接伤害击杀时：</span><br>目标死亡时爆炸，在 7.5 米内造成同属性武器伤害（边缘衰减至 0%）：<div class=\"bul\">・手炮：74 <span class=\"unsure\">[77?]</span> 伤害</div><div class=\"bul\">・微型冲锋枪：289 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span> 伤害</div><div class=\"bul\">・狙击步枪：552 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span> 伤害</div></div>",
"shopping-special\t煅炉眷属\t异域词条":"<div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">用黑色军械库武器击杀，或任意击杀后 7 秒内切出该武器时：</span><br>获得「<span class=\"perk\">煅炉眷属</span>」（手持时开始计时，到期前无法刷新；装备件数越多效果越强）：<div class=\"bul\">・×1：+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑+15</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 弹药生成，持续 5 秒</div><div class=\"bul\">・×2：对<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>伤害提高 5% <span class=\"enh\">↑7%</span>，+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 弹药生成，持续 7 秒</div><div class=\"bul\">・×3：对<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>伤害提高 10% <span class=\"enh\">↑13%</span>，+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 弹药生成，持续 9 秒</div></div><p><span class=\"note\">异域武器「</span><span class=\"exotic\">伊邪那岐的重担</span><span class=\"note\">」「</span><span class=\"exotic\">冰霜巨人</span><span class=\"note\">」「</span><span class=\"exotic\">帝王蝶</span><span class=\"note\">」计入装备件数，但自身不获得增益。</span></p>",
"shopping-special\t熔岩激涌\t异域词条":"<div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">造成伤害后完成填装时：</span><br>获得 <span class=\"stack\">1 层</span>「<span class=\"perk\">熔岩激涌</span>」，最多叠加 <span class=\"stack\">3 层</span>（收枪移除）：<div class=\"bul\">・×1：+10<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性、+10 <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度、填装动画时长 0.967×</div><div class=\"bul\">・×2：+20<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性、+20 <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度、填装动画时长 0.934×</div><div class=\"bul\">・×3：+45<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性、+45 <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度、填装动画时长 0.9×</div></div>",
"shopping-special\t燃烧野心\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">在彼此间隔 2 秒内造成与弹匣挂钩的直击次数时：</span><br>2 秒内的下一次直击施加<span class=\"deb-solar\">灼烧</span>（计为武器伤害；计数收枪后保留，不限同一目标）。<br>施加<span class=\"deb-solar\">灼烧</span>后进入 0.5 秒全局冷却。</p><p>主要武器施加 <span class=\"stack\">10+5 层</span><span class=\"deb-solar\">灼烧</span> <span class=\"pvp\">[</span><span class=\"unsure\">4+5? 层</span><span class=\"pvp\">]</span>；特殊与威能武器施加 <span class=\"stack\">20+10 层</span><span class=\"deb-solar\">灼烧</span>。<br><span class=\"deb-solar\">灼烧</span>弹直击以及对已带<span class=\"deb-solar\">灼烧</span>目标的直击均可施加。</p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">触发所需直击命中数（弹匣的 55%，向下取整）：</span><div class=\"bul\">・弓箭：<span class=\"enh\">↑2</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・刀剑：2 <span class=\"enh\">↑1</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・精密线性融合步枪：<span class=\"enh\">↑1</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・点射线性融合步枪：<span class=\"enh\">↑2</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・火箭手枪：<span class=\"enh\">↑3</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・精密斥候步枪：<span class=\"enh\">↑5</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・速射斥候步枪：<span class=\"enh\">↑8</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・融合步枪：<span class=\"enh\">↑11</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・适配机枪：<span class=\"enh\">↑13</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・攻击型机枪：<span class=\"enh\">↑19</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・速射机枪：<span class=\"enh\">↑28</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・热量／精密自动步枪：<span class=\"enh\">↑14</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・适配／支援型自动步枪：<span class=\"enh\">↑19</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・速射自动步枪：<span class=\"enh\">↑23</span> 次</div><div class=\"bul\">・追踪步枪：<span class=\"enh\">↑29</span> 次</div></div>",
"shopping-special\t爆破专家\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">武器击杀时：</span><br>提供 10% <span class=\"enh\">↑11%</span> 手雷技能能量（融合步枪、偃月、霰弹枪与狙击步枪为 20% <span class=\"enh\">↑22%</span>）。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">使用手雷技能时：</span><br>填满弹匣（弹匣填充有 3 秒冷却）。</p>",
