"shopping-special\t瓦解破裂\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">击破元素护盾、屏障或<span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span>护盾时：</span><br>目标受到的<span class=\"el-kinetic\">动能</span>伤害提高 50%，持续 5.5 <span class=\"enh\">↑</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"pvp\">[5]</span> 秒（不影响<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>与<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>伤害）。<br>可多次触发叠加，每层独立计时并以乘法叠加，且与所有其他<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>和<span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>叠加。</p>",
