"shopping-special\t老兵睿智\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">造成<span class=\"stack\">精准击杀</span>或 3 秒内连杀 3 名目标时：</span><br>在目标死亡位置触发<span class=\"el-kinetic\">动能</span>冲击波，在 8 <span class=\"enh\">↑9</span> 米内造成无衰减伤害，并施加疲惫（输出伤害降低 25%，持续 10 秒）。</p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">各武器类型冲击波基础伤害：</span><div class=\"bul\">・自动步枪 ｜ 脉冲步枪：20</div><div class=\"bul\">・狙击步枪：23</div><div class=\"bul\">・微型冲锋枪 ｜ 融合步枪 ｜ 刀剑：<span class=\"unsure\">?</span></div></div>",
"shopping-special\t聚合充能\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">对受元素<span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>影响的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>造成伤害时：</span><br>伤害提高 10% <span class=\"enh\">↑11%</span> ｜ 20% <span class=\"enh\">↑22%</span> ｜ 30% <span class=\"enh\">↑33%</span>。<br>加成随目标身上不同<span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>数量递增，达 3 种不同<span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>时达到上限。</p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">计入的不同元素<span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>：</span><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>：<span class=\"deb-arc\">致盲</span>、<span class=\"deb-arc\">震颤</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>：<span class=\"deb-solar\">灼烧</span>、<span class=\"deb-solar\">点燃</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span>：<span class=\"deb-void\">压制</span>、<span class=\"deb-void\">不稳定</span>、<span class=\"deb-void\">虚弱</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>：<span class=\"deb-stasis\">减速</span>、<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>、<span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>：<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>、<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span>、<span class=\"deb-strand\">瓦解</span></div></div>",
"shopping-special\t聚焦狂怒\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">以<span class=\"stack\">精准命中</span>打出弹匣容量 35%（向上取整）的发数时：</span><br>伤害提高 25%，持续 11 <span class=\"enh\">↑12</span> 秒。<br>收枪或填装重置命中计数；生效期间可刷新，收枪后保留（不提高爆炸类伤害）。</p>",
"shopping-special\t肾上腺素成瘾\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">武器或手雷击杀时：</span><br>伤害提高 6.7% ｜ 13.3% ｜ 20% ｜ 26.6% ｜ 33.3%，+20 操控性，持续 4.5 <span class=\"enh\">↑5</span> 秒。<br>手雷击杀直接赋予 <span class=\"stack\">5 层</span>（收枪状态下击杀同样生效）。<br>再次以武器或手雷击杀可刷新持续时间；后台可触发，收枪后保留。</p>",
"shopping-special\t脆弱专注\t异域词条":"<p>护盾存在时被动提供 +20 射程。<br>护盾被击破时失效；护盾完全回满 1 <span class=\"enh\">↑0.5</span> 秒后重新生效。</p>",
