"shopping-special\t超充弹匣\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\"><span class=\"el-arc\">增幅</span>期间：</span><br>每 1.5 秒填充 5% 弹匣。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">获得速度提升期间：</span><br>每 0.25 秒填充 5% 弹匣；通过填充最多可使弹匣容量提高 100%。</p><p>两种填充效果收枪期间同样生效。</p><p><span class=\"enh\">↑被动提供 +15 弹匣属性。</span></p>",
"shopping-special\t超凡时刻\t异域词条":"<div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">武器击杀时：</span><br>按武器元素阵营获得对应<span class=\"buff\">增益</span>，持续 7 秒（再次击杀刷新；收枪后保留）：<div class=\"bul\">・光明武器（<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>／<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>／<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span>）：触发「<span class=\"el-prismatic\">超凡</span>之光」，+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 稳定性、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑+20</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性</div><div class=\"bul\">・黑暗武器（<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>／<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>）：触发「<span class=\"el-prismatic\">超凡</span>之暗」，+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑+20</span> 射程、+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑+20</span> 瞄准辅助</div></div><p><span class=\"cond\">处于<span class=\"el-prismatic\">超凡</span>状态期间：</span><br>同时激活两种阵营加成，直到<span class=\"el-prismatic\">超凡</span>结束。</p>",
"shopping-special\t超因果亲和\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">造成同阵营属性击杀时：</span><br>伤害提高 20%，持续 6 <span class=\"enh\">↑7</span> 秒。<br>继续以同阵营来源击杀可刷新持续时间；后台可触发，收枪后保留。</p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">阵营对应：</span><div class=\"bul\">・光明阵营：<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>、<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>、<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・黑暗阵营：<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>、<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span></div></div>",
"shopping-special\t超因果流体\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">造成伤害时：</span><br>获得「<span class=\"perk\">超因果流体</span>」，持续 3 秒（收枪后仍然生效）：<br>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性、+50 敏捷、+90 <span class=\"enh\">↑</span>+<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 充能效率。</p>",
