"shopping-special\t转向\t异域词条":"<p><span class=\"cond\">命中<span class=\"bar-red\">红血</span><span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>时：</span><br>获得 <span class=\"stack\">2 层</span>「转向」，最多叠加 <span class=\"stack\">30 层</span>；收枪后保留。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">命中<span class=\"bar-orange\">橙血</span>、<span class=\"bar-yellow\">初级首领</span>、<span class=\"bar-yellow\">首领</span>或载具时：</span><br>单次开火消耗至多 <span class=\"stack\">3 ↑2 层</span>，每层使伤害提高 33% <span class=\"enh\">↑50%</span>，消耗 <span class=\"stack\">3 ↑2 层</span>时达到最高 +100%（命中免疫目标同样消耗）。</p>",
